# motion-anti-slop

32+ deterministic **block** / **warn** rules in seven groups:

- **A. Duration tells** — too short / too long defaults
- **B. Ease abuse** — `back.out(1.7)` / `elastic.*` / `bounce.*` as defaults (only one branded character moment per page)
- **C. Choreography** — hover lift+scale+shadow combo, parallax on every section
- **D. Accessibility** — missing `prefers-reduced-motion` (Pre-Flight Failure), scrub/pin under reduced-motion
- **E. Performance** — animating layout properties, will-change abuse
- **F. Composition** — single accent leak, AI-purple default, type pool drift
- **G. Wiring & loading silent failures** — `gsap.from(autoAlpha:0)` on CSS-hidden element, CSS transform pre-existing, jsdelivr ESM, esm.sh named imports for plugins, MotionPath/DrawSVG on non-path

Each rule has detect signature, wrong snippet, fix snippet, severity (`block` / `warn`).

For the full A–G checklist with all detect/fix snippets: see `skills/motion-anti-slop/SKILL.md`.
